      "writtenOn": "2026-10-22T05:28:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "MCTP VDM. Each Id is the sensor id dbus-sensors puts in the Get Temperature Reading request it sends to this SMA (PowerSensors and VoltageSensors use Get Current Power Draw and Get Voltage). The entries now also carry the Name the reading is published under, e.g. {Id 17, Name SMA_Internal} becomes HPM_0_SMA_Internal.\n\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/95095/1..5/configurations/nvidia/vr_nvl_superchip.json#26",
      "parentUuid": "73693263_d4f728f0",
